{title: Madhuban Khushboo Deta Hai}
{artist: Yesudas}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Madhuban khushboo deta hai,
[A]saagar saawan [F]deta hai
[Am]Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A]jo auro ko [F]jeewan deta hai
[Am]Madhuban khushboo deta hai
[A]Suraj na [D]ban paaye to,
[D]banke deepak [A]jalta chal
[A]Phool mile [D]ya angaare,
[D]sach ki raaho [A]pe chalta chal
[G]sach ki raaho [A]pe chalta chal
[Am]Pyaar dilo ko deta hai,
[A]ashqo ko [F]daaman deta hai
[Am]Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A]jo auro ko [F]jeewan deta hai
[A]Chalti hai [D]lehraake pawan,
[D]ke saans sabhi [A]ki chalti rahi
[A]Logo ne [D]tyaag diye jeewan,
[D]ke preet dilo [A]mein palti rahe
[G]ke preet dilo [A]mein palti rahe
[Am]Dil woh dil hai jo auro ko,
[A]apni dhadhkan [F]deta hai
[Am]Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A]jo auro ko [F]jeewan deta hai
